c BelaOkuma 2017-2026

!! IMPORTANT: update PIM and SMS together !!
PIM v1.2 only works with SMS v1.5: the data goes over the network now.
An old SMS v1.4 gets no PIM data (PIM shows a warning).

### developed with MDK2 and claude ###

new in update 1.2a:
 - PIM sends its data to SMS over the network (IGC), no longer into the CustomData of SMS
 - hint if a PB still runs SMS v1.4
 - SMS terminal menu "Control (no) Refinerys/Assemblers": PIM sets/removes the (sms) tag
